abstract: >
  Online supplementary materials for the study "Healthy is fresh": 
  A participatory study of meal ideals and barriers shaping food 
  choice in rural Colombia. Includes workshop materials, quantitative 
  analysis scripts, qualitative data, and evidence from participatory 
  co-design sessions with 41 adults across three rural subregions 
  of Antioquia, Colombia.
